        "First aid preserves life, prevents deterioration and promotes recovery, begins with the safety of the rescuer and an early call to 112, and follows DRSABCDE with a ten-second breathing check, the recovery position for the breathing unconscious, a jaw thrust where the spine may be injured, nothing by mouth, warmth and a timed handover.",
